<h2>The Challenge</h2>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">{{ subtitle }}</p>
  <p>
    Staring at the Sun wanted a visual identity that goes past traditional album artwork. It needed to evolve with their music, tell a story and reach audiences on streaming platforms and social media. My role was to develop a consistent 3D animated style for Spotify Canvas loops, animated music videos and cryptic promotional content that teases future releases.
  </p>
</div>

